  "Configure global network settings:\n\n  • Hostname and domain\n  • Default IPv4 and IPv6 gateways\n  • DNS nameservers (up to three)\n\nChanges take effect immediately after saving.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Cumraigh socruithe líonra domhanda:\n\n  • Óstainm agus fearann\n  • Geataí IPv4 agus IPv6 réamhshocraithe\n  • Freastalaithe ainm DNS (suas le trí cinn)\n\nTagann athruithe i bhfeidhm díreach tar éis iad a shábháil."
  },
