  "Configure network settings": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Cumraigh socruithe líonra"
  },
  "Configure networking for this TrueNAS system.\n\n  • Interface settings  – DHCP, IP aliases, MTU\n  • Network settings    – Hostname, domain, gateways, DNS\n  • Static routes       – Add and remove static routes\n\nChanges to interfaces require a commit step\nbefore they take effect.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Cumraigh líonrú don chóras TrueNAS seo.\n\n  • Socruithe comhéadain – DHCP, ailiasanna IP, MTU\n  • Socruithe líonra – Óstainm, fearann, geataí, DNS\n  • Bealaí statacha – Cuir leis agus bain amach bealaí statacha\n\nTeastaíonn céim thiomnaithe de bharr athruithe ar chomhéadain\nsula dtéann siad i bhfeidhm."
  },
